-Rollouts progress via cohorts: e.g., `canary-1%`, `canary-10%`, `region-us-east`, `global`. Progression is driven by explicit operator action or an automated controller that gates on health signals (SLO error budget, crash loops, config-agent self-revert rate). The key is that gating uses **independent telemetry** (service metrics), not just “agent applied successfully,” because semantic failures often manifest only under real traffic.
